{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04164","headline":"寓居洛滨对雪忆谢二 · 骆宾王","name":"寓居洛滨对雪忆谢二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"旅思眇难裁，冲飙恨易哀。\n旷望洛川晚，飘颻瑞雪来。\n积彩明书幌，流韵绕琴台。\n色夺迎仙羽，花避犯霜梅。\n谢庭赏方逸，袁扉掩未开。\n高人傥有访，兴尽讵须回。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"骆宾王","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04164.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04164","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}